WEBVTT

00:01.130 --> 00:14.830
<b>The Last Boss Queen awakens to memories of her former life</b>

00:06.080 --> 00:14.830
<b>Meets her adopted brother</b>

00:08.080 --> 00:14.830
<b>and her younger sister</b>

00:11.250 --> 00:14.830
<b>and time goes on...  </b>

00:23.920 --> 00:29.330
Oh, that means you and Big Brother
are going to get married, right?

00:29.460 --> 00:30.210
What?

00:30.790 --> 00:31.920
That's right.

00:31.920 --> 00:35.630
The matrimony of adopted siblings
became commonplace

00:35.630 --> 00:38.210
even in the royal family quite some time ago.

00:38.210 --> 00:38.960
You're open!

00:38.960 --> 00:39.790
Hm?

00:43.830 --> 00:44.630
Stale!

00:49.500 --> 00:54.290
The Stale in the otome game
I was playing, "Our Ray of Light,"

00:55.040 --> 00:59.170
has feelings of love starting to grow toward Tiara
in the middle phase of the game, but...

01:00.540 --> 01:04.250
But perhaps Stale already has those feelings for her...

01:10.830 --> 01:13.880
It's been three years since the day I got
the memories from my previous life back.

01:14.500 --> 01:18.500
The days have continued on peacefully,
unlike in the game.

01:19.540 --> 01:23.000
If Stale has no more painful memories since that incident,

01:23.460 --> 01:27.880
and Tiara is not kept captive in the
a tower far away like in the game,

01:28.250 --> 01:32.130
then I am already leading a different life
than I had in the game.

01:34.000 --> 01:36.960
But there's something I want to make sure of...

01:38.130 --> 01:38.880
Sir.

01:38.880 --> 01:39.710
Yes?

01:40.460 --> 01:42.830
There's a favor I'd like to ask of you.

03:20.210 --> 03:22.500
<b>"The Heretical Princess and the Knights"</b>

03:22.750 --> 03:23.580
Pride...

03:23.960 --> 03:26.130
Don't strain yourself, okay?

03:27.170 --> 03:28.330
I'm fine!

03:37.290 --> 03:38.130
Amazing...

03:39.790 --> 03:43.380
Today is the first time I've held a sword and
it's unbelievable that I've already come this far.

03:43.380 --> 03:44.880
And swordsmanship is just the start of it.

03:45.080 --> 03:48.750
I have an astounding memory where once
I've learned something, I don't forget it.

03:48.750 --> 03:52.710
I've perfectly mastered the art of
self-defense just by watching it.

03:53.250 --> 03:57.080
I knew Pride was more than
just an otome game antagonist.

03:58.920 --> 04:00.580
She's the last boss in this world.

04:02.080 --> 04:03.790
And that's precisely why she has...

04:04.170 --> 04:06.130
a formidable last boss cheat!

04:07.790 --> 04:10.830
This is how the self-defense combat
went the other day too, but...

04:10.830 --> 04:14.500
doesn't this mean that there's no place
for me at your side, Elder Sister?

04:14.960 --> 04:19.000
The teachers said that you were plenty
impressive yourself, Big Brother!

04:19.290 --> 04:22.080
It's just that Big Sister is beyond amazing.

04:22.750 --> 04:26.580
But there's no point if I'm weaker than
the one I should be protecting, Tiara.

04:27.830 --> 04:29.580
Don't feel discouraged, Stale.

04:29.830 --> 04:32.630
I'm positive you'll become stronger than I am.

04:33.130 --> 04:35.750
At any rate, I won't stand a chance
against those with pure strength.

04:36.380 --> 04:37.250
Strength?

04:37.460 --> 04:38.670
Yes, it's true.

04:38.670 --> 04:43.080
For example, in a situation where I can't escape,
if I'm pinned down by a man,

04:43.420 --> 04:45.500
there's nothing I can do.

04:45.830 --> 04:49.750
No escape... man... pinned...

04:52.290 --> 04:55.250
Mr. Carl! I'm ready to continue my lessons!

04:55.420 --> 04:56.080
Yes, my prince.

04:56.420 --> 04:57.420
Big Sister...

04:58.960 --> 05:04.130
I'm not strong either... nor am I good at anything, but...

05:06.540 --> 05:10.880
To make sure you never meet that fate,
I'll stay right beside you!

05:16.500 --> 05:17.960
Thanks, Tiara.

05:18.290 --> 05:20.790
I'm sorry I've caused you to worry unnecessarily.

05:21.290 --> 05:27.830
But it's all right, since we have Father, Stale,
the guards, and the knights with us.

05:29.750 --> 05:33.540
As the last boss, I am endowed with the cheat ability.

05:34.210 --> 05:38.710
After all, my destiny is to progress
per the story in the game.

05:39.170 --> 05:45.670
No, I may very well reach my guilty sentence
much sooner than in the game...

05:47.080 --> 05:54.630
Even so, I'm happy that I can spend days
like these together with Tiara and Stale.

06:05.710 --> 06:07.670
Thank you very much for coming,

06:07.960 --> 06:12.130
Your Majesties, First Princess Pride,
and First Prince Stale.

06:12.500 --> 06:15.920
Oh? I don't see the captain of the knights here...

06:16.290 --> 06:17.580
I am terribly sorry.

06:17.830 --> 06:19.750
The captain had to leave in a hurry

06:19.750 --> 06:23.670
to accompany new soldiers for joint military exercises
being held with a neighboring country.

06:23.790 --> 06:27.790
Originally, we had planned for the knights
in that land to lead our new recruits,

06:27.790 --> 06:31.420
but we never got correspondence from them,
even when it was time to leave.

06:32.000 --> 06:37.330
On short notice, the captain headed out
to lead the new recruits in a joint exercise.

06:37.790 --> 06:42.040
I see. As long as they do that,
they can check the status of the neighboring land,

06:42.040 --> 06:46.920
and it's better for the Captain to be there
in person to make the right decision.

06:47.750 --> 06:52.670
Mr. Carl, today is First Princess Pride's first observation,
and it should be commemorated.

06:53.290 --> 06:56.000
Shouldn't they have reported this in advance?

06:57.170 --> 07:00.330
Please forgive me. You are quite right.

07:00.830 --> 07:06.040
Oh, no, I also knew about
the new soldiers' joint military exercise,

07:06.420 --> 07:09.000
so I should have checked with you beforehand.

07:09.670 --> 07:10.750
Besides,

07:11.130 --> 07:17.330
previously I heard from the captain that
all of the knights he trained are outstanding.

07:17.830 --> 07:22.920
They're more than sufficient,
even when the captain is absent.

07:25.830 --> 07:29.380
First Princess Pride is always so open-minded.

07:35.830 --> 07:38.830
Basic training occurs daily without fail.

07:39.040 --> 07:40.670
Not only are practice drills done with swords,

07:40.670 --> 07:45.080
but we also practice sharpshooting
and horseback riding in hypothetical battles.

07:45.540 --> 07:49.880
As I thought, they are perfectly capable
even without their captain.

07:50.250 --> 07:55.500
I'll also learn a lot from this, like truly understanding
the chain of command and emergency measures.

07:55.790 --> 07:57.080
Thank you.

07:58.210 --> 08:04.580
It's awful that in the future, Pride uses these
talented soldiers to do no more than

08:04.580 --> 08:07.790
betray themselves, oppress their countrymen,
and battle with other countries.

08:08.500 --> 08:09.880
How very stupid.

08:10.420 --> 08:17.170
Princess Pride, you are eleven years old,
but you are just as sharp as they say you are.

08:17.170 --> 08:19.920
Huh? No, I'm not quite that...

08:20.330 --> 08:24.420
It is no wonder that you've been entrusted with
the position of Vice Captain of the Knights, Sir Clark.

08:24.630 --> 08:27.290
I see you're well-informed
on the gossip within the palace.

08:27.790 --> 08:30.210
No, it's a popular topic.

08:32.540 --> 08:34.290
So there's a rumor like that going around...

08:35.380 --> 08:36.830
I have a message!

08:37.580 --> 08:38.830
What is the meaning of this?!

08:39.000 --> 08:41.040
The soldiers that Captain Rodrick was commanding

08:41.040 --> 08:43.710
suffered a surprise attack on their way
to the neighboring lands!

08:44.790 --> 08:47.290
We're relying on you for guidance, Vice Captain...

08:47.290 --> 08:49.580
Will you please come to the
conference room as soon as possible?!

08:49.580 --> 08:53.170
Wait, I must first take the princess somewhere safe.

08:53.500 --> 08:58.460
If you must ensure our safety, Stale will accompany us.

08:59.790 --> 09:04.750
I also must see the movement of the knights
in an emergency situation myself.

09:06.210 --> 09:08.250
Rodrick, it's me.

09:08.250 --> 09:10.290
Tell me what the situation is over there.

09:10.880 --> 09:14.000
There's been no change since the previous report.

09:14.000 --> 09:17.630
There have been no fatalities,
but the number of injured keeps growing.

09:18.040 --> 09:20.580
I've heard this is a special ability of a new recruit.

09:21.210 --> 09:23.880
Images are being transmitted to both sides.

09:24.960 --> 09:25.920
Who is the enemy?

09:25.920 --> 09:29.130
Most probably those who oppose
an alliance with neighboring countries.

09:29.830 --> 09:32.920
There was a sudden landslide,
and the roads were blocked.

09:33.630 --> 09:36.290
The attackers are continuing to fire from the clifftop.

09:36.710 --> 09:39.670
Even if we were to retreat,
there's nowhere to take shelter behind us.

09:40.080 --> 09:42.420
We've already sent more troops out to you.

09:43.000 --> 09:47.040
A vanguard of personnel with special abilities
should arrive in 30 minutes.

09:47.380 --> 09:49.500
Please hold out until then.

09:50.170 --> 09:54.170
Understood. I wish we had ammunition
to last until then, but-

09:54.630 --> 09:57.500
That means support is 30 minutes away at the earliest...

09:58.040 --> 10:02.630
Right now, the most urgent thing is the relief supplies.

10:03.040 --> 10:04.170
Princess Pride?!

10:04.630 --> 10:09.080
Stale. I'll need your help for this, do you mind?

10:09.500 --> 10:12.330
I will do anything you wish, First Princess Pride.

10:14.130 --> 10:16.670
Bring the weapons and ammunitions
you'll need here immediately.

10:16.670 --> 10:17.580
Huh?

10:17.960 --> 10:20.670
Stale's special ability is teleportation.

10:20.960 --> 10:25.960
As long as he knows the coordinates, he can send
things that are around his body weight anywhere.

10:26.420 --> 10:29.830
It will be little by little,
but let's send the materials to the site.

10:30.290 --> 10:34.330
Are you mad? The First Princess and
the First Prince, personally assisting us?!

10:34.330 --> 10:39.670
What's more important right now is keeping
even one more of our soldiers alive!

10:41.710 --> 10:44.460
Captain! Our ammunition supply has run out!

10:45.210 --> 10:47.540
First aid for injured soldiers in progress!

10:48.630 --> 10:51.880
I've stopped the bleeding!
I can head back to the frontlines too!

10:57.080 --> 11:01.630
Everyone's getting their morale back,
like their previous exhaustion was just imagination!

11:03.380 --> 11:04.670
Teleportation.

11:05.420 --> 11:11.130
Despite his young age, he never tried to flaunt such
an amazing ability and actually kept it a secret until now?

11:12.500 --> 11:17.210
And also, his trust and allegiance
towards an adamant Princess Pride...

11:18.500 --> 11:23.710
What a fearsome card you had hidden up
your sleeve, First Princess Pride...

11:24.670 --> 11:26.580
That is truly an amazing ability.

11:26.920 --> 11:31.830
How about having Prince Stale drop bombs
directly on the enemy soldiers?

11:32.500 --> 11:35.460
You fool! What a disrespectful statement!

11:37.040 --> 11:38.460
Please, forgive my behavior!

11:38.460 --> 11:42.130
It's not a problem if my Elder Sister wishes for it, but...

11:42.500 --> 11:46.250
I don't. That's not something you should do.

11:46.880 --> 11:50.290
I apologize on behalf of the new recruit
for that improper remark.

11:50.710 --> 11:54.420
Of course... Please make sure he gets a good scolding.

11:55.040 --> 11:58.830
Well, you've already done so, Captain.

11:59.630 --> 12:01.040
Also, if possible...

12:02.420 --> 12:05.880
I order you not to mention anything
about Stale's special ability.

12:06.330 --> 12:09.080
His ability is not for the sake of fighting,

12:09.080 --> 12:13.290
and I only want him to use it for what
he wishes for and what he wants to protect.

12:15.580 --> 12:16.710
As you wish.

12:17.540 --> 12:21.920
Vice Captain! The vanguard will arrive
at the battlefield in 10 minutes!

12:22.330 --> 12:28.080
Okay, half will go to the aid of Rodrick's troops,
and the other half will capture the enemy at the clifftop!

12:28.330 --> 12:31.250
Clark, pass this along to the vanguard!

12:31.750 --> 12:33.460
Tell them the ground here is unstable,

12:33.830 --> 12:36.040
and to be extremely careful of their footing.

12:36.380 --> 12:37.250
Yes, sir!

12:38.500 --> 12:39.710
The ground?

12:40.250 --> 12:41.880
The ground is unstable?

12:41.880 --> 12:44.710
What is this? I've heard it before somewhere...

12:47.670 --> 12:52.670
Originally, this was a land with loose soil. And so, my...

12:56.710 --> 12:59.290
The vanguard must not go up to the clifftop.
The cliff will crumble!

12:59.880 --> 13:01.380
I've just foreseen it!

13:09.250 --> 13:13.500
That cliff will collapse before long!

13:13.960 --> 13:18.960
The attackers and our knights will be crushed
underneath the rubble and they may all perish!

13:19.630 --> 13:25.250
I, First Princess Pride, user of precognition which is
proof of the right to the throne, command you to do so!

13:25.250 --> 13:29.830
The vanguard are to be given a
withdrawal route to a safe zone,

13:29.830 --> 13:35.170
and as many new recruits as possible
should be given priority to withdraw.

13:35.170 --> 13:35.670
Hurry!

13:35.670 --> 13:37.380
Send word to the correspondence unit!

13:36.170 --> 13:37.130
Let's move!

13:37.540 --> 13:39.040
You heard that, Rodrick?

13:39.290 --> 13:42.040
You and the others must move away from the cliff now!

13:42.500 --> 13:47.420
Yes, it's all right. Everyone aside
from myself is far away from the cliff.

13:47.540 --> 13:49.170
Then you get a move on, too!

13:50.750 --> 13:52.920
Can... you move?

13:55.630 --> 13:59.710
When the boulder was dropped, as luck would have it,
my leg got caught in the rubble.

14:00.130 --> 14:05.580
I can't free myself no matter what I try. If it had totally
crushed my leg I could've had a luckier break.

14:10.380 --> 14:11.250
Huh?

14:16.830 --> 14:18.580
Slash Nullification.

14:19.750 --> 14:21.630
It's the Captain's special ability.

14:22.330 --> 14:31.000
Regardless of his intentions, slashing attacks from sharp
objects like swords or blades will deal him no damage.

14:31.580 --> 14:36.580
In short, it is also impossible for him
to cut his leg off and escape.

14:37.540 --> 14:38.580
Oh no...

14:41.540 --> 14:43.960
It's a shame, but seems like this is the end for me.

14:45.080 --> 14:47.580
You're in charge now, Clark.

14:48.830 --> 14:50.750
I will die here, as a knight-

14:50.750 --> 14:51.880
What the hell do you mean?!

14:55.460 --> 14:56.290
Who are you?!

14:56.290 --> 14:57.830
Get him out of here, now!

14:58.500 --> 14:59.330
Stop it!

14:59.670 --> 15:02.670
That child is Captain Rodrick's son!

15:05.960 --> 15:09.920
What is this! What do you mean?!

15:10.290 --> 15:12.580
You... Why are you there?!

15:12.790 --> 15:15.880
You terrible father! What will mother do?!

15:16.580 --> 15:20.580
She worries about you every single time,
and now you're going to just give up?!

15:21.380 --> 15:22.960
You're so full of it!

15:23.670 --> 15:26.920
Aren't you "The Untouchable Knight"?!
The Captain of the Knights?!

15:27.250 --> 15:30.170
Don't you die in a place like that!

15:30.380 --> 15:35.380
Stand up, you terrible father! Get home right now
and give Mom ten thousand apologies!

15:35.380 --> 15:37.790
I'm sorry. That would be impossible.

15:43.170 --> 15:45.960
I will die here, as a knight.

15:46.460 --> 15:51.210
I wanted to, at the very least,
give you lessons one more time.

15:51.920 --> 15:54.080
Looks like you've finally run out of bullets, eh?!

15:54.080 --> 15:55.830
Wasted us a lot of time, ya jerk!

15:56.080 --> 16:01.290
I don't need lessons! I told you before,
I'll never become a knight!

16:01.790 --> 16:07.750
It's your life. I will no longer strongly discourage you
from not becoming a knight.

16:08.540 --> 16:09.920
It's just, I...

16:10.790 --> 16:17.830
I wanted you to also know about the knights
who serve me at the risk of their lives,

16:18.750 --> 16:19.880
as a father.

16:21.830 --> 16:23.750
Cut off communication from our side.

16:27.130 --> 16:28.460
Good decision.

16:28.830 --> 16:30.880
Wait, Clark! What the hell are you doing?!

16:30.880 --> 16:33.830
We can't afford to give the enemy
any information from our side.

16:34.290 --> 16:37.750
Get a load o' this! His foot's stuck and he can't move!

16:39.500 --> 16:42.540
Past me are the new recruits with a future before them.

16:42.830 --> 16:46.130
I have no intention of allowing you to lay
a hand on them until support arrives!

16:46.670 --> 16:48.500
The hell are you talkin' about?!

16:48.500 --> 16:50.420
Not happenin'.

16:50.960 --> 16:53.000
Let's take 'im out now!

16:54.330 --> 16:55.330
Watch, my son.

16:55.920 --> 16:57.630
Watch your father's last breath!

17:02.040 --> 17:02.960
Stop...

17:05.460 --> 17:07.920
Stop... Stop...

17:10.250 --> 17:13.630
Stop... Stop it! Stop it!

17:14.710 --> 17:18.710
Stop, stop, stop!

17:19.250 --> 17:26.130
I can't do a thing. Even though I decided to give
the rest of my life to this country... to the people...

17:27.000 --> 17:31.580
And all I can do is stare, dumbfounded, at this tragedy.

17:41.540 --> 17:44.040
A gun'll work on him! Stand back!

17:45.000 --> 17:46.040
Stop it!

17:50.880 --> 17:54.040
Someone! Help my father!

17:54.630 --> 17:56.290
He's your captain, isn't he?!

17:57.250 --> 17:59.380
Why are there so many knights...

17:59.920 --> 18:03.250
and none of you... not a single one of you can...

18:03.710 --> 18:06.290
Why can't anyone help my father?!

18:09.290 --> 18:10.420
It's all right.

18:14.500 --> 18:17.670
I won't let the people of my country, not a single one,

18:21.420 --> 18:22.750
experience misfortune!

18:31.710 --> 18:34.500
Stale, send me to that battlefield.

18:35.580 --> 18:37.000
Elder Sister, I can't do that!

18:37.000 --> 18:40.670
You foresaw the danger, and should
know that better than anyone else!

18:42.330 --> 18:44.880
It will be all right, trust me.

18:45.540 --> 18:49.210
You are the First Princess!
That battlefied isn't somewhere you shou-

18:49.210 --> 18:50.130
I...

18:51.790 --> 18:55.880
Even though I could save my people
for my own self-interest, I won't.

18:56.710 --> 19:00.080
I don't want to become that sort of atrocious queen...

19:02.790 --> 19:07.460
If I become the worst queen...

19:11.880 --> 19:14.420
You're sure it'll be okay, right?

19:15.000 --> 19:15.920
I'm positive.

19:32.460 --> 19:33.790
Is this it?

19:34.330 --> 19:36.170
Finally giving up?!

19:37.130 --> 19:38.670
Fire! Give him the final shot!

19:48.330 --> 19:49.330
What's going on?

20:03.670 --> 20:06.250
Get ready, you hoodlums!

20:08.290 --> 20:12.080
Why are you here?! Get away from here, right now!

20:12.080 --> 20:14.130
You are a citizen of my country.

20:24.830 --> 20:25.630
Captain!

20:31.750 --> 20:34.830
Is that really an 11 year old girl?

20:38.540 --> 20:40.210
That brat! She's messin' with the wrong ones!

20:40.210 --> 20:41.960
Everyone, attack!!

20:57.880 --> 21:00.000
Damn! Who is that brat?!

21:01.290 --> 21:03.670
Whoa, hey... this is a joke, right?

21:09.630 --> 21:10.710
Get 'em!

21:12.880 --> 21:14.210
She a monster or somethin'?

21:21.080 --> 21:22.170
It's collapsing...

21:22.580 --> 21:23.460
I've found you!

21:26.040 --> 21:26.880
Captain!

21:28.080 --> 21:32.920
If you don't want me to die,
grab onto him tightly and don't let go!

21:35.960 --> 21:37.710
You stupid... Let go!

21:42.080 --> 21:44.710
Wh-why'd you say that?!

21:44.830 --> 21:48.080
Hurry, or you'll get buried alive too!

21:50.580 --> 21:54.210
Damn it!

23:28.630 --> 23:33.830
The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:
From Villainess to Savior.

23:34.670 --> 23:38.130
Episode 4: "The Worst Princess
and the Young Man's Vow."

23:36.040 --> 23:41.000
<b>"The Worst Princess and the Young Man's Vow"</b>
